Article 1 (Enforcement date)
This Decree shall enter into force on the date of its promulgation; provided, the amended provisions of Article 8(2), 13(5), Appendix 2, and subparagraph 1-2 of the Note to Appendix 3 shall enter into force on January 1, 2002.
Article 2 (Transitional measures concerning calculation of period of work experience on board ships)
